Why: A file already carries the backup's name /srv/nage/data/backups/[STAMP]-pre-migrate-0001-to-[version].sqlite, and Nage never writes over a file. Nothing was changed.
What now: Run nage migrate again in a moment, since the name carries the time to the second; move that file out of the backups folder only if Nage did not write it.
